BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:1-on-1 Career Consultations with ACCES Employment Session 1
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261209T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261209T140000
UID:6ae39893ebad22004548e03f@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Are you feeling stuck in your job search? Explore the incredib
 le resources and expertise offered by ACCES Employment. Connect with an Em
 ployment Consultant to get tailored resume reviews\, invaluable interview 
 tips\, and a wealth of additional support. Have a free 30-minute appointme
 nt and embark on a remarkable journey toward your dream job\, like 1-1:30 
 pm\, 1:30-2 pm.\nPlease bring your finished resume/cover letter to the ses
 sion & your specific questions during the consultation\, for example edit
 ing your resume\, job search\, volunteer opportunities\, or Interview pre
 paration etc.\nPlease cancel as soon as possible if you no longer need the
  session before the program starts. (\nKind reminder:\nPlease register for
  or join the waitlist for only one session per day.)\nSpace is limited. He
 lp is available on a first-come\, first serve basis.\nPlease arrive a few 
 minutes early.\nIf no slots are available on your desired consultation dat
 e\, contact ACCES Employment directly for an appointment at\n416-443-9008\
 n(North York Location) /\n416-921-1800\n(Downtown Location). Or visit\nacc
 esemployment.ca\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the
  Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 
 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and program
  registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library h
 andles your information can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline
 @tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Albert Campbell\, Small Meeting Room\, 2nd fl.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ae39893ebad22004548e03f
X-SOURCE:Volunteer Toronto
END:VEVENT
